{"agent":"bg107","data":{"digest":"e17d2f643f4dccc8","finding":1,"gate":"rubber_duck","location":"ddflow/services/ci/runner.py:552","probe":"Refuted: _execute returns _run_stages(...) (runner.py:534), and _run_stages returns a 3-tuple on both paths -- return p, \"\", spent (line 562) and return p, before, spent (line 592). spent IS accumulated: initialized from p.elapsed_s (552) then spent += p.elapsed_s per stage (579). The reviewer's chunk 2/4 only showed the spent=p.elapsed_s snapshot line and the scope.unran region, not the return statements, so it missed the two returns. No ValueError: 3 values are returned.","severity":"HIGH","title":"ddflow/services/ci/runner.py:552","verdict":"refuted"},"id":"e1db4992e071b5cdfec83598c","kind":"review.triaged","lamport":158454,"schema":1,"subject":"fix-B28537b615d","ts":"2026-11-09T02:13:59.215998Z"}
